  "note": "Extracted by hand from the how-to-order tables of the three 600 series sheets, which share one grammar: eight single character positions then a dash and the size, exactly as the price book prints them (666FTTS-025). Each sheet fixes its own trim, so the options are the union of the three and the constraints keep the printed combinations: brass ball and stem with PTFE seats on the two 666 sheets, stainless ball and stem with RPTFE seats on the 633, whose header names stainless steel trim. Only the full port brass sheet carries the 2-1/2, 3 and 4 inch sizes; the reduced port sheet starts at 1/2 inch and the stainless sheet stops at 2 inch.",
